MyCube character assets
=======================

No third-party character model is bundled.

A CC0 glTF path was preferred (Quaternius Ultimate Animated Character Pack
on OpenGameArt; Kenney animated character kits). Those packs ship as FBX,
OBJ, or Blend files. This environment has no Blender, assimp, or
gltf-pipeline available to convert them, and Kenney.nl blocked automated
downloads (HTTP 403). Shipping an unconverted 48MB FBX pack would not work
with the Three.js AnimationMixer + per-part recolor workflow used here.

Characters are therefore original procedural meshes built at runtime in
public/js/room3d.js (chunky stylized proportions, MeshToonMaterial, inverted-
hull outlines, expressive faces). They are an original look and are not a
copy of any commercial character.

